        "original_id": "b8bc7293-f59f-51d8-88b1-9fdfe938d957",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. Shivaram Karanth\n- Topics: Yakshagana\n- Works: Marali Mannige\n\nFacts:\n- Kota Shivaram Karanth was born on 10 October 1902 and died on 9 December 1997.\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was a Kannada writer, social activist, environmentalist, Yakshagana artist, filmmaker, and thinker.\n- Yakshagana is a traditional theatre form in Kannada and Tulu culture that combines dance, music, dialogue, costume, make-up, and stage techniques in a distinctive style.\n- Marali Mannige is a Kannada novel by K. Shivaram Karanth.",
